#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to update your project so that it works with Qiskit 1.0."
msgstr ""
"Comment mettre à jour ton projet pour qu'il fonctionne avec Qiskit 1.0."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit 1.0 migration guide"
msgstr "Guide de migration Qiskit 1.0"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit 1.0 migration guide {#qiskit-10-migration-guide}"
msgstr "Guide de migration Qiskit 1.0 {#qiskit-10-migration-guide}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit 1.0 brings new stability guarantees and performance improvements, but it\n"
"does break compatibility with all previous versions of Qiskit. See the\n"
"following guides on updating your environment and code to work with Qiskit v1.0.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit 1.0 apporte de nouvelles garanties de stabilité et des améliorations "
"de performances, mais il rompt la compatibilité avec toutes les versions "
"précédentes de Qiskit. Consulte les guides suivants pour mettre à jour ton "
"environnement et ton code afin de les faire fonctionner avec Qiskit v1.0.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Install the new Qiskit v1.0 package](/guides/qiskit-1.0-installation) for "
"upgrading Python environments and project dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Installer le nouveau paquet Qiskit v1.0](/guides/qiskit-1.0-installation) "
"pour mettre à niveau les environnements Python et les dépendances de "
"projet.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Qiskit v1.0 feature changes](/guides/qiskit-1.0-features) for updating your"
" code.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Changements de fonctionnalités de Qiskit v1.0](/guides/qiskit-1.0-features)"
" pour mettre à jour ton code.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Breaking package changes of Qiskit v1.0](/guides/metapackage-migration) to "
"understand the new and old package structure.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Modifications incompatibles du paquet Qiskit v1.0](/guides/metapackage-"
"migration) pour comprendre la nouvelle et l'ancienne structure de paquets.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read more about the benefits of Qiskit v1.0 on the [IBM&reg; "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-1-0-release-summary).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour en savoir plus sur les avantages de Qiskit v1.0, consulte le [blog "
"IBM&reg;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-1-0-release-summary).\n"
